# Generic DPLL drivers configuration
#

menuconfig DPLL
	bool "DPLL drivers configuration"
	help
	  DPLL driver configuration subsystem which provides general interface
	  to configure devices that use any kind of Digital PLL and could use
	  different sources of input signal to synchronize to, as well as
	  different types of outputs.

if DPLL

config MLX5_DPLL
	tristate "Mellanox 5th generation network adapters (ConnectX series) DPLL support"
	depends on MLX5_CORE
	help
	  DPLL support in Mellanox Technologies ConnectX NICs.

	  This option enables support for Digital Phase-Locked Loop (DPLL) functionality
	  in Mellanox 5th generation network adapters (ConnectX series). DPLL allows
	  precise time synchronization between network nodes, which is essential for
	  time-sensitive applications such as financial trading or telecom systems.

	  Enabling this feature provides access to advanced time synchronization hardware
	  capabilities, useful for configurations involving PTP (Precision Time Protocol).

	  If you don't know what to do here, say N.
endif
